window.__legalHtml="<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"en\"><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\">\n<title>mochii terms of service<\/title>\n<link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Geist:wght@400;500;600&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n<style>:root{--bg:#f6f5f2;--card:#fff;--text:#1d1c1a;--muted:#6b6862;--line:#e4e1da;--accent:#c4702a}@media (prefers-color-scheme:dark){:root{--bg:#121212;--card:#1b1b1b;--text:#ecebe8;--muted:#9a978f;--line:#2c2c2c;--accent:#e89a52}}*{box-sizing:border-box}body{margin:0;background:var(--bg);color:var(--text);font:15px/1.65 Geist,-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,\"Segoe UI\",sans-serif}main{max-width:720px;margin:0 auto;padding:48px 16px 80px}h1{font-size:28px;font-weight:600;margin:0 0 4px}h2{font-size:17px;font-weight:600;margin:32px 0 6px}.date,.foot{color:var(--muted);font-size:13px}.foot{margin-top:40px;padding-top:16px;border-top:1px solid var(--line)}a{color:var(--accent)}ul{padding-left:20px}\nmain:not(:target){display:none} body:not(:has(main:target)) #terms{display:block}<\/style><\/head>\n<body><main id=\"terms\"> <h1>terms of service<\/h1> <div class=\"date\">last updated october 27, 2026<\/div> <p>by using mochii you agree to these terms. if you don't agree, don't use it.<\/p> <h2>18 and over only<\/h2> <p>you must be 18 or older to use mochii. if you're under 18, don't use it or make an account. by using mochii you confirm you're at least 18. if we think an account belongs to someone under 18 we'll delete it.<\/p> <h2>what mochii is<\/h2> <p>mochii is a free web proxy browser with games, music, chat and an ai assistant. it's provided as is, with no guarantees that it works, stays online, or keeps your data forever.<\/p> <h2>your responsibility<\/h2> <p>you're responsible for how you use mochii. follow the laws where you live and the rules of any network you're on, including work policies. mochii doesn't give you permission to get around rules that apply to you.<\/p> <h2>not for school<\/h2> <p>mochii isn't for use at school or on school networks or devices. we don't support using it to get around school filters, blocks or monitoring, and doing so breaks these terms.<\/p> <h2>don't use mochii to<\/h2> <ul> <li>break the law, or access, share or store illegal content.<\/li> <li>get around filters, blocks or monitoring at a school, or on a network or device you aren't allowed to bypass.<\/li> <li>harass, threaten, impersonate or dox anyone.<\/li> <li>post spam, malware, or sexual content involving minors.<\/li> <li>attack, overload or scrape mochii, its wisp servers, or other sites.<\/li> <li>get around limits like the ai daily limit, for example with lots of accounts.<\/li> <\/ul> <h2>accounts and chat<\/h2> <p>keep your password safe; you're responsible for what happens on your account. you own what you post, but you let us store and show it so the chat works. we can remove content or suspend accounts that break these terms, without notice.<\/p> <h2>ai<\/h2> <p>ai replies can be wrong, made up, or inappropriate. don't rely on them for medical, legal, financial or other important decisions. usage is limited per day.<\/p> <h2>third party content<\/h2> <p>sites you visit through the proxy, games, and music from youtube or soundcloud belong to their owners and follow their own terms. we aren't responsible for them.<\/p> <h2>liability<\/h2> <p>to the extent the law allows, mochii and its makers aren't liable for any damages from using or not being able to use the service, including lost data.<\/p> <h2>changes<\/h2> <p>we can change these terms or the service at any time. we'll update the date at the top when we do.<\/p> <h2>contact<\/h2> <p>questions or reports? reach us on <a href=\"https://discord.gg/cmzz7cRqaH\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">discord<\/a>.<\/p> <div class=\"foot\">questions? find us on <a href=\"https://discord.gg/cmzz7cRqaH\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">discord<\/a>. see also the <a href=\"#privacy\">privacy policy<\/a>.<\/div> <\/main><main id=\"privacy\"> <h1>privacy policy<\/h1> <div class=\"date\">last updated october 27, 2026<\/div> <p>this explains what mochii collects, where it goes, and what you can do about it. short version: most things stay in your browser, accounts store a little on our database, and we don't sell anything to anyone.<\/p> <h2>stuff that stays in your browser<\/h2> <p>settings, themes, wallpapers, tabs, proxy server choice, custom wisp servers, music recents, ad block stats and similar data are saved in your browser's local storage. we never see it. clearing your site data deletes it.<\/p> <h2>accounts<\/h2> <p>accounts are optional and shared with mochii chat. when you make one we store:<\/p> <ul> <li>your username and a hashed password (handled by supabase auth). we don't ask for a real email.<\/li> <li>your public profile: username, avatar and anything else you put on it. <b>profiles are readable by everyone<\/b>, so don't put private info there.<\/li> <li>site settings and search history you choose to sync. only your account can read these.<\/li> <li>chat messages and images you post in mochii chat, which other users can see.<\/li> <\/ul> <h2>ai<\/h2> <p>messages you send on the ai page go through our relay to groq, which generates the reply. we don't keep your conversations. to enforce the daily limit we store token counts per account and per network. the network is stored as a one-way hash of your ip address, never the raw ip.<\/p> <h2>browsing through the proxy<\/h2> <p>sites you visit are fetched through a wisp server, which may be run by us or a third party you pick. those servers carry your traffic and could see it, especially for sites without https. we don't log the pages you visit. the sites themselves get whatever you send them, same as normal browsing.<\/p> <h2>third parties<\/h2> <ul> <li><b>supabase<\/b> stores account, chat and usage data.<\/li> <li><b>vercel<\/b> hosts the site and may keep standard request logs.<\/li> <li><b>groq<\/b> processes ai messages.<\/li> <li><b>youtube and soundcloud<\/b> serve music played in mochii music, under their own policies.<\/li> <li><b>google fonts<\/b> serves fonts.<\/li> <\/ul> <p>we don't run ads, analytics or tracking pixels.<\/p> <h2>under 18s<\/h2> <p>mochii is only for people 18 and over. if you're under 18, don't use it or make an account. if you think someone under 18 made one, message us on <a href=\"https://discord.gg/cmzz7cRqaH\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">discord<\/a> and we'll delete it.<\/p> <h2>your choices<\/h2> <p>you can edit your profile, clear your search history, or ask us on <a href=\"https://discord.gg/cmzz7cRqaH\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">discord<\/a> to delete your account and the data tied to it. clear your browser's site data to remove everything stored locally.<\/p> <h2>changes<\/h2> <p>if this policy changes, we'll update the date at the top. continuing to use mochii means you accept the new version.<\/p> <div class=\"foot\">questions? find us on <a href=\"https://discord.gg/cmzz7cRqaH\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">discord<\/a>. see also the <a href=\"#terms\">terms of service<\/a>.<\/div> <\/main>\n<script>const t={\"terms\": \"mochii terms of service\", \"privacy\": \"mochii privacy policy\"},s=()=>document.title=t[location.hash.slice(1)]||t.terms;s();addEventListener(\"hashchange\",()=>{s();scrollTo(0,0)});<\/script>\n<\/body><\/html>";</script> <meta charset="UTF-8"> <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"> <meta name="description" content="Coursera | The best place to learn anything, anywhere"> <title>Coursera | Online Courses</title> <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com"> <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin> <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Lexend:wght@300..600&display=swap"> <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=I