button></div> <button type="button" class="row setting-toggle" data-setting-toggle="autoBlank"><span class="row-text"><b>always open in about:blank</b><small>jumps over on your first click each time you open mochii. needs popups allowed</small></span><span class="switch"><i></i></span></button> <button type="button" class="row setting-toggle" data-setting-toggle="confirmClose"><span class="row-text"><b>ask before closing</b><small>stops the tab from being closed by accident</small></span><span class="switch"><i></i></span></button> </div> </section> <section class="settings-pane hidden" data-settings-pane="extensions"> <div class="settings-pane-title">extensions</div> <p class="ext-lead">real chrome extensions, straight from the chrome web store. they run inside mochii with their own background, popups and content scripts.</p> <div class="group"> <div class="group-title">installed</div> <div id="ext-installed"></div> </div> <div class="group"> <div class="group-title">marketplace</div> <div class="ext-search"><input type="text" id="ext-market-search" placeholder="search the chrome web store, or paste a store link" spellcheck="false" autocomplete="off" aria-label="search extensions"></div> <div class="ext-chips" id="ext-market-cats"></div> <div id="ext-market"></div> </div> <div class="group"> <div class="group-title">developer</div> <div class="row"><div class="row-text"><b>load unpacked</b><small>a .zip or .crx package, or a folder with a manifest.json</small></div> <div class="background-actions"> <button class="btn" id="extension-upload-zip" type="button">zip / crx</button> <button class="btn" id="extension-upload-folder" type="button">folder</button> </div> <input id="extension-zip-input" type="file" accept=".zip,.crx,application/zip" hidden> <input id="extension-folder-input" type="file" webkitdirectory hidden> </div> </div> </section> <section class="settings-pane hidden" data-settings-pane="account"> <div class="settings-pane-title">account</div> <div id="account-body"></div> <div class="group"> <div class="group-title">activity</div> <button type="button" class="row setting-toggle" data-setting-toggle="shareActivity"><span class="row-text"><b>show what i'm playing</b><small>puts the game, anime, show or song you have on your chat profile, like "playing flappy bird", "watching frieren" or "listening to blinding lights". needs an account</small></span><span class="switch"><i></i></span></button> <button type="button" class="row setting-toggle" data-setting-toggle="chatNotify"><span class="row-text"><b>chat notifications</b><small>pops up when someone pings you or sends you a dm, wherever you are on the site. dnd in the chat mutes them</small></span><span class="switch"><i></i></span></button> </div> </section> <section class="settings-pane hidden" data-settings-pane="about"> <div class="settings-pane-title">about</div> <div class="group"> <div class="about-logo">mochii</div> <p class="about-line">cool web pr0xy, developed by atmoss.</p> <p class="about-line">please join the discord!!</p> <div class="about-links"> <a href="https://github.com/atmo1lost" target="_blank" rel="noopener">github</a> <a href="https://discord.gg/cmzz7cRqaH" target="_blank" rel="noopener">discord</a> </div> </div> <div class="group"> <div class="row"><div class="row-text"><b>tour</b><small>a quick walkthrough of where everything is</small></div> <button class="btn" id="replay-tour" type="button">take the tour</button></div> <div class="row"><div class="row-text"><b>keyboard shortcuts</b><small>or press ? anywhere on mochii's own pages</small></div> <button class="btn" id="open-shortcuts" type="button">show</button></div> </div> <div class="group"> <div class="group-title">what's new</div> <div class="changelog" id="settings-changelog"></div> </div> <div class="group"> <div class="group-title">status</div> <div class="status-hero" id="status-hero"></div> </div> <div class="group"> <div class="group-title">proxy servers</div> <div class="status-rows" id="status-servers"></div> </div> <div class="group"> <div class="group-title">this browser</div> <div class="status-grid" id="status-grid"></div> </div> </section> </div> </div> </div> </div> <div class="extension-surface-modal hidden" id="extension-surface-modal"> <div class="extension-surface-card" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-labelledby="extension-surface-title"> <div class="extension-surface-header"><span id="extension-surface-title">extension</span><button class="close-btn" id="extension-surface-close" type="button" aria-label="close">&times;</button></div> <div class="extension-surface-body" id="extension-surface-body"></div> </div> </div> <div class="wisp-settings-modal hidden" id="setup-wizard"> <div class="wizard-card" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-labelledby="wizard-title"> <div class="wizard-dots" id="wizard-dots"></div> <h2 id="wizard-title"></h2> <p class="wizard-sub" id="wizard-sub"></p> <div class="wizard-body" id="wizard-body"></div> <div class="wizard-actions"> <button class="btn grow" id="wizard-back" type="button">back</button> <button class="btn" id="wizard-skip" type="button">skip for now</button> <button class="btn primary" id="wizard-next" type="button">next</button> </div> <button class="acct-switch" id="wizard-signin" type="button">already have an account? sign in</button> </div> </div> <script>/* p/js/app/utils.js */
